---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="A brief window into who is behind Luffy, why this space exists, and the tools that power it.">
  <article class="prose w-full">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold tracking-tight text-text mb-6">
      About Me
    </h1>

    <p>
      Hello there. My name is **Luffy**.
    </p>

    <p>
      This website is a tiny personal satellite in the expanding universe of the internet. It is 
      where I collect my thoughts, document the projects I build, and think out loud.
    </p>

    <p>
      I’ve spent a lot of time on social networks, and while they are excellent for distribution, 
      they are terrible for contemplation. This blog is my rejection of the feed. It has no view counters, 
      no feedback algorithms, and no notifications. It’s just a quiet place to put down thoughts 
      and hope they find a sympathetic reader.
    </p>

    <h2>Why the name "Luffy"?</h2>
    <p>
      In stories, the character Luffy represents a pure, unshakeable pursuit of freedom, curiosity, 
      and deep friendship. He navigates a vast, chaotic ocean with a small, trusted crew, charting his 
      own course regardless of the prevailing winds. That feels like a fitting metaphor for how we 
      should navigate the modern digital world: autonomously, playfully, and surrounded by things 
      and people we care about.
    </p>

    <h2>What I Do</h2>
    <p>
      By day, I design systems and write code. By night, I experiment with ideas that don’t have to 
      make business sense. I am deeply interested in:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Small Tech:</strong> Software that is fast, local-first, and respects user ownership.</li>
      <li><strong>The Craft of Writing:</strong> Crafting narratives that are clear, empathetic, and engaging.</li>
      <li><strong>Analog Tools:</strong> The durability of notebooks, paper maps, and mechanical watches.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>
    <p>
      This site is built with extreme simplicity in mind:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Framework:</strong> <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank">Astro</a> (no client-side javascript frameworks).</li>
      <li><strong>Styling:</strong> <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank">Tailwind CSS v4</a> (for utility classes and fast design variables).</li>
      <li><strong>Typefaces:</strong> Classic serif stack (Georgia/Cambria) for highly comfortable reading.</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> <a href="https://pages.github.com" target="_blank">GitHub Pages</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs font-mono text-text/50">
      Last updated: August 2026.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
